Package: proxc
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.6)
Description: Smart Proxy Liveness Checker and Security Toolkit
 High-performance, zero-dependency, cross-platform CLI tool for validating
 proxies. Supports bulk list files (CSV, TXT, LST) and single proxy checks
 with real-time streaming output, multi-threading, protocol auto-detection
 (HTTP, HTTPS, SOCKS4, SOCKS5), and comprehensive metadata detail cards.
